Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.26,0:00:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every wall that's\Nin our wake, go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That surely someday we\Njust might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.78,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.42,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves are rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Our wishes, they will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.86,0:01:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings, many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.06,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.70,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on. Never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up. If brains\Nare rough, jump to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Luffy, take a good\Nlong look at this lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.94,0:02:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to cross it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.66,0:02:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be impossible\Nto get across that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.94,0:02:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Half's on fire, the other half's frozen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the temperature of the\Nwater should be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.28,0:02:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's swim. You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin and I can't get wet,\Nso you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.52,0:02:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to imply that\Nwe should carry you across?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.02,0:03:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, if we don't cross, we'll\Nhave to go all the way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.60,0:03:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, let me see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Green Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Grow, Fangrass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen this plant before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Booty banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.78,0:03:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A boot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is awesome, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can use this Fangrass's oars.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.32,0:03:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got so many different seeds now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pretty handy, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There were a bunch of crazy\Nplants in the Bowen Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The deeper I went into\Nthe dangerous areas,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the more useful the plants\NI found along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.12,0:03:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I survived there for two whole years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no difficulty I\Ncan't overcome! Nope! Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, get on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.74,0:03:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or we'll leave you! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't forget who supplied the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.52,0:03:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take that away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:04:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I want snow cones!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.56,0:04:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you rowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So breezy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a strong headwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the temperature difference here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It creates a change in air\Npressure, causing wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the water's boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, if we tried to swim across,\Nwe'd have been poached pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you row any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.58,0:04:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try helping us, you bum?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.78,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that centaur again! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you changed your\Nmind and decided to join us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you quit recruiting folks, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.18,0:04:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's not like we need any more\Nstrange creatures joining the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.24,0:04:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A horn?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy on the snail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He said something about a boss, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.00,0:04:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, it's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We need boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish off the intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're headed right for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.34,0:05:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the shore on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.14,0:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The distress signal was meant for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, we don't\Nhave anything to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This boss guy's got bigger problems\Nto deal with than us washing ashore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a man among them\Nwho's carrying swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he the samurai who attacked our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, I'll make him pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.26,0:05:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something creepy about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like we're being\Nwatched by Akainu and Aokiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The thought gives me chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go back. Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a river!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Smokey! That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you know there was a\Nriver behind that block of ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was pretty impressive, Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you got Saru\Nvision or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can tell by looking at\Nthe sea current, you morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You men need to start paying attention and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,work on your attitudes while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It is worrisome, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That it is. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that there was a hidden\Nriver is not what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In this situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,what really matters is whether the ice\Nblocking it formed naturally or was man-made.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.16,0:06:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Smokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.48,0:07:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean somebody might have been\Nhiding the river from us on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, nobody lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's full of poisonous gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd have to be crazy to want to\Nlive out their days in a gas mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The man on the snail definitely\Nmentioned the name of this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.16,0:07:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably just misheard him, Tashigi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a transponder\Nsnail could survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.62,0:07:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've got time to laugh, you've\Ngot time to break up more ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, it's a giant wall of ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Her warship is strong, but it's\Nno match for something that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to destroy it! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah-choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.36,0:07:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to bust out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.56,0:08:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really fired up,\Naren't you, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.66,0:08:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji trusted me with\Nan important mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I gotta do my\Nbest to protect the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes\Nto get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.78,0:08:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you out of here if\Nit's the last thing I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be scared, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I laugh in the face of\Ndanger, because I'm a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think we should go from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.74,0:08:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just security.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's up to you, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.20,0:08:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss? Are you sure I'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're experts at getting\Nout of dangerous situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax and follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.70,0:08:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.42,0:09:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you made me mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons, live!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.06,0:09:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got weapons all over his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.24,0:09:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he must be the one who\Nbroke the door open. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.16,0:09:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you guys want\Nto get to know me better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll spend as much\Ntime here as you want, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Load the poison gas canisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The kits are gone, the coast is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.06,0:09:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fire at will!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You should take off your masks, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to smoke\Npoisonous gas with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.22,0:09:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, there's no reason to get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He rips our masks off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.22,0:10:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And he broke our air tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.80,0:10:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use gas canisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what in the hell are you? Sheep?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what are you doing down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who on earth could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This foe is different from\Nthe others I've fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been challenged like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're quite the formidable opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.98,0:10:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I got no clue what you're\Ntalking about, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.27,0:10:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My torso's currently in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.98,0:10:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you and why are\Nyou attacking me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd your head go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And where are your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.40,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How fretful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you can speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.24,0:11:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready? Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to reach the\Nend of the river soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.03,0:11:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what we'll find there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a pretty good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to be a\Nghost bike, Chance, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, you need to obey the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't come out during the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you attacking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.54,0:11:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The only reason I came ashore\Nwas to make a snow army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we build snowmen instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make snow sculptures if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.10,0:12:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how\Nhe can attack with such
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,precision when he doesn't\Neven have any eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remembered!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any eyes either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong! And... stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.12,0:12:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I demand answers from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you at least tell\Nme why you wish to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:12:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hop-up-cour-droit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now he's really\Nstarting to scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't handle it! He's so creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And now somebody save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You called master? Yes,\Ndid you capture the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,escapees not yet but i\Nhave news about g5 sir
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh them i'm afraid the\Npoison gas didn't stop them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.90,0:13:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been firing their\Ncannons to break through the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.08,0:13:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,ice flows They're slowly forcing\Ntheir way onto the island
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.66,0:14:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they'll make their\Nway to the laboratory soon. This is
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.38,0:14:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,quite vexing why do They want to\Ncome ashore so badly do they know
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.04,0:14:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,something we don't tell me who is\Ntheir commanding Officer vice admiral
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,smoker oh is that so irksome but
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.70,0:14:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,not entirely unexpected i suppose
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Conceal the ships we\Nhave moored at the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's going to deal with them, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed to be on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you cannot let them see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So you'll deal with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.76,0:14:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't afford to reveal myself to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.30,0:14:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nobody else who can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to handle it? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no gas here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:14:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There was definitely poisonous gas\Nearlier, so where the hell did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.28,0:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I assume it was released by\Nsomeone who doesn't want us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, who'd do that to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. This is Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,At least it used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.12,0:15:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be anyone here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was abandoned a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Think someone could be living here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.14,0:15:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out and face us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong are you\Nafraid of us or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we don't just have to stand here\Nringing the bell waiting for him to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.44,0:15:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,all we really got to do is break down the\Ndoor with our cannon smoky that I mean mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker, sir Anyone in there? Answer us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Open this door or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trespassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's allowed on this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.62,0:15:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender at once, or we're coming for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.64,0:16:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me what brings you to my vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,home white hunter oh man you gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Be kidding me? He used to be a rookie\Nwith a 440 million berry bounty but now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,he's among them dracula hawkeye Mihawk
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,the pirate empress boa hancock don
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,quixote do flamingo pirates backed by\Nthe world government the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.56,0:16:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We should just go back\Nto the ship, Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.04,0:17:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything to do\Nwith him after what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard about it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to become a member\Nof the Seven Warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He delivered the hearts of a hundred\Npirates to the Navy headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's off the rails.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy's a creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to tell me\Nwhat you're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you're aware that no one's\Nallowed to step foot in this island law.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not pirates or government\Nallies. That clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you aren't allowed either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.20,0:17:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy! Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what you said to me earlier,\Nabout how you guys aren't sick anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it like before?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.40,0:18:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, like what kind of\Ndisease did you guys have?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All they told us is that\Nwe were real sick and that
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it would take us a whole\Nyear to get well again,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,so we had to come here and rest up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.10,0:18:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And they didn't tell you what was wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.28,0:18:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess maybe my parents found\Nout I was sick and asked the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,people who work here to pick\Nme up and help me get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.02,0:18:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how I ended up with this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents really sent you away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just playing outside one day and\Nthose people showed up out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.52,0:18:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they brought me here\NThey said I had to go with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,them right away or else my mom\Nand dad might get infected,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,too
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.90,0:18:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even get to say goodbye to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:19:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, this sounds like\Nstraight-up kidnapping to me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.88,0:19:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So a bunch of strangers took\Nyou to some weird place without
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.68,0:19:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,letting you say bye to your parents\NThat could only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You kids are really sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They were lied to, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.64,0:19:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting too tired, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.68,0:19:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can always carry you on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the master takes really\Ngood care of us. The master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.58,0:19:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get right on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So try this at home, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.48,0:19:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You can thank me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're handy these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good job, Mr. Raccoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.14,0:19:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not a raccoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.06,0:19:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you do look like\None now. You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we should hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.50,0:20:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, give me your fur!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.66,0:20:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this lead outside, or\Nis that some kind of freezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's way too dark to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The temperature's perfect, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.20,0:20:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a door back there. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go see what's behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.38,0:20:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.96,0:20:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, they'll catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I can't, because that's the\Nway they brought me in when I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.76,0:20:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, that means it must be an exit then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.02,0:20:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's cold, but\Nyou can make it. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.00,0:20:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.72,0:20:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.62,0:21:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like there's\Nsomething inside the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.40,0:21:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.56,0:21:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary because the\Nwalls are full of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those corpses?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Encased in walls of ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And the ceiling? Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The floor, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be the\Nbonob, so you don't leave us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.06,0:21:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.68,0:21:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You already blocked their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.48,0:21:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all we needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.94,0:21:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.98,0:21:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I heard Nami screaming\Nher lungs out just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.24,0:21:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's professing her love\Nfor me, then I have to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.32,0:22:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, anyway, who are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.76,0:22:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Half-man, half-sheep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.02,0:22:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there some kind of creature\Nlike that from a fairy tale?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.22,0:22:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Franky,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but identifying fairy tale characters is\Npretty far down my Daddy list right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.80,0:22:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a damsel to save first!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.12,0:22:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.03,0:22:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Unhand me, then! Leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not see my son among\Nall the children we set free.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps there are more rooms here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to stay and - And what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.02,0:22:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any arms or legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.60,0:22:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If I leave you here alone, that means\Nit's my fault if anything bad happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.88,0:22:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I care not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.98,0:22:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My only goal now is to save my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.86,0:22:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on my last nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to say is\Nhelp me find my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.08,0:22:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Swallow your pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Asking for help from you pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.50,0:22:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I would rather die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.36,0:22:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I suppose if you truly are that\Ndesperate to locate the rest of my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop you from searching.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.92,0:23:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not taking any more lip from a head!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.56,0:23:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it's come to\Nthis, I accept my fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.96,0:23:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I died with\Nmy honor still intact!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroying a helpless severed head\Nwon't make you feel any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.12,0:23:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you really\Nweren't taking his crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,then you wouldn't have\Nbrought him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.90,0:23:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.88,0:23:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I was stupid enough\Nto be moved by his determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.00,0:23:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.98,0:23:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.89,0:23:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to help him Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.74,0:23:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure you must pity a poor\Ndisembodied head who can't even
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,defend himself if someone attacks\NSo would you like to carry me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.28,0:23:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.94,0:23:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it as soon as you have an ass to\Nkick you best believe I'm gonna kick it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.40,0:23:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You show no mercy even to\Nthose who can do you no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.66,0:23:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a fearsome foe indeed pirate\NMaybe Nami found a way out. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.60,0:24:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts. Itches.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.14,0:24:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.58,0:24:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, and I'm going to\Nbe king of the pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.04,0:24:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to tell them all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.48,0:24:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.98,0:24:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.60,0:24:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, it's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.64,0:24:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We need boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.31,0:24:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.42,0:24:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are getting cut\Ndown, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.66,0:24:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai is gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.26,0:24:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.94,0:24:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please hurry, we're on\Nthe island of Punk Hazard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.44,0:24:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He said cold, and named the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.00,0:24:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Given those facts,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.46,0:24:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,it's almost undeniable that the signal\Nwas sent from here on Punk Hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.02,0:24:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've met Straw\NHat before, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.16,0:25:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Repel!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.16,0:25:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now room and shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.66,0:25:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.14,0:25:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years ago, during an incident involving\Nthe Roswals, a celestial dragon family,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.06,0:25:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you, Luffy, and Kid fought together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.22,0:25:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We know what happened at\Nthe War of the Best, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.52,0:25:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, hand over Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand him over and we can escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.18,0:25:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll die without my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.86,0:25:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat escaped Aka 'inu's clutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.06,0:25:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And you helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.70,0:25:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.30,0:25:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to know you Marines are\Npretty good at faking those times.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.66,0:25:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,distress signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.57,0:26:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're suggesting this is a trap\Nwe set, I'm sorry to say you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.94,0:26:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.08,0:26:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sorry, I have no\Nmore information for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.70,0:26:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I both know that's bullcrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.10,0:26:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I want to see what's inside that lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.36,0:26:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my vacation home, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.38,0:26:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.72,0:26:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You abandoned this place, so why can't a
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.14,0:26:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,pirate come to relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.18,0:26:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anybody else around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.62,0:26:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And if Straw Hat does show, I'll behead\Nhim for you if there's nothing else?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.28,0:26:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear those voices?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.34,0:26:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.46,0:26:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're free now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.38,0:26:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.50,0:26:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.94,0:26:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of the building!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.04,0:27:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.16,0:27:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to see Mom and Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cold now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.38,0:27:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.18,0:27:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Super duper tank's here to save the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.60,0:27:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna squash that and find\Nit that gets him away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for cute baby animals and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.06,0:27:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,SUPER!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.04,0:27:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Frank in the tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.86,0:27:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,SUPER!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.00,0:27:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly are we looking at here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.68,0:27:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant kids, a raccoon,\Na robot, a severed head,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.88,0:27:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and a lady who's not\Ndressed for the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.18,0:27:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy! I know him! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.26,0:27:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw him in Sabaody!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.06,0:27:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the creep who\Nkidnapped those children?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.68,0:27:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.88,0:27:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.06,0:27:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.38,0:27:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.08,0:27:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoker, I'd recognize\Nthat ugly mug anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.18,0:28:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And Tashigi looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.00,0:28:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.12,0:28:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.12,0:28:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Change of plans, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.50,0:28:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for another exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.10,0:28:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be a back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.20,0:28:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.50,0:28:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Will we bring the Navy\Nto a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.02,0:28:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me! Let's just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.08,0:28:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I always thought\Nthe Navy were good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.38,0:28:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, go with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.72,0:28:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.44,0:28:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They look kind of mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.40,0:28:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So you did lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There are others here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.72,0:28:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.63,0:28:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But that was a shock for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.38,0:28:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Marines!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.29,0:28:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Track down the straw-hot pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.76,0:28:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.86,0:28:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, men, follow her!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.38,0:28:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.90,0:28:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Room
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.12,0:28:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.20,0:29:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Those fools bring trouble wherever they go
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.24,0:29:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And tact.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.94,0:29:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A battleship that's floating\Nin midair. The river's
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.98,0:29:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,up there too what the\Nhell that makes no sense
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.52,0:29:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,i lied to you for your own good you should\Nhave listened now that you've seen the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,truth i'm afraid i can't let you leave
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.10,0:29:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we're so screwed aren't we stay behind me
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.88,0:29:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you're no match for law he'll\Ndismember you on the spot
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.24,0:29:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,KUKUSMORBIUS SHOWING THE G5 MEANS BUSINESS
